  "changes": [
    "Containers header, filters and empty guidance scroll with results; narrow and accessibility layouts adapt, and Search or dragging dismisses the keyboard.",
    "Live safe-area constraints keep the three-section dock above the home indicator. Heading, Tools, dock captions and persistent create action use bounded font growth; body text retains full accessibility scaling.",
    "Proxy cards replace their interior artwork and layout while retaining original action carriers, control targets, enabled and hidden states, model associations and user values. Unknown structures show an owned unavailable row.",
    "Added exact source-owned routes for current sessions, session import, batch Cloud upload, session export and session destination. Original tables, delegates, navigation actions, selection, spinner, search and secure input objects remain authoritative.",
    "Backup type copy changes only in the verified native badge slot; filenames and other data remain exact. Section-header overlays retain original tags and gesture carriers.",
    "The exact CloudPlans store alias joins denied marketplace routes; licensed Cloud routes remain admitted. Archive display descriptions use SocialBox while identifiers, suffixes, formats and routing remain unchanged.",
    "Header callback admission validates the actual installed method encoding; an inherited or protocol signature cannot mask an unsupported section argument ABI. Original callbacks run once before owned drawing.",
    "Saved-proxy selection indicator uses a leading vertical wrapper; regression checks its actual 22-point UIKit alignment rectangle to prevent stretching."
  ],
